/Title (EarnWise is an intelligent micro-savings and investment platform designed for gig workers with irregular income. It analyzes incoming payouts against a 30-day earnings average and automatically allocates a safe portion toward emergency savings, tax reserves, and micro-investments while maintaining a minimum balance for daily expenses. The platform combines multi-source income tracking, forecasting, behavioral risk profiling, targeted savings goals, explainable automation with one-click undo, and a state-grounded AI financial copilot to help users manage unpredictable income with minimal effort.)
